{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With stunning, realistic 3D graphics and an intuitive control system, Phantom Ops offers a truly immersive experience. Whether you\u2019re a seasoned shooter enthusiast or a newcomer, the game offers an adrenaline-pumping challenge where every decision counts. The combination of quick thinking and strategic choices ensures that no encounter is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563950/extras/logo_phantom.png?t=1741040311\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a variety of dynamic maps, each presenting their own unique advantages and obstacles. Whether navigating complex cityscapes or vast open battlefields, adaptability is key. Phantom Ops offers two thrilling game modes: Control Point, where players must compete to dominate strategic locations, and Elimination, which pits teams against each other to eliminate opponents and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563950/extras/person.png?t=1741040311\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With endless opportunities to showcase your skills, whether it\u2019s strategy or precision shooting, Phantom Ops caters to all playstyles. Gear up and prove your worth in the ultimate battle for supremacy!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563950?t=1741040311","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563950/658fd1f52117312d7f37ae4005a3683d5a5ce312/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741040311","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563950/1ce0afbe0ee484fdf4f8b55455ef1eaafca25972/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741040311","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_